    "body": "Owner request (12 October 2026): add acknowledgements for **Wil Dahn** (W33-Theory) and **John Haines** for theory discussions on the high-level geometry and its allowed pathing.\n\n- README § Acknowledgements only; two new lines before the AI-labs line, matching the format of #2173.\n- Wil Dahn's line links the W33-Theory repository and the two places the repo already reviews it (external research audit, 2026-10-12 W(3,3) overview).\n- No capability claim changes; `python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py` passes at this head.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
